## 8. Network Architecture (Current + Planned)

### Current Setup

```
Internet
    ↓
ER605 (router + firewall + ACL + DHCP)
    ↓
Dumb switch 1 → Prod Proxmox server (trunk all VLANs)
Dumb switch 2 → Dev Proxmox server (trunk all VLANs)
                NAS
Mac Mini → ER605 (management access)
```

### Planned Setup (After Switch Integration)

```
Internet
    ↓
ER605 (router + firewall + cross-env ACL + VPN)
    ↓
FS308GP Managed Switch (VLAN switching + intra-env routing)
    ├── Port 1: Prod Proxmox server (trunk VLANs 50-55)
    ├── Port 2: Dev Proxmox server  (trunk VLANs 60-65)
    ├── Port 3: NAS                 (VLAN 40)
    ├── Port 4: Uplink to ER605     (trunk all VLANs)
    └── Port 8: Management/AP
```

### VLAN Design

| VLAN | Environment | Purpose |
|------|-------------|---------|
| 5 | Management | Proxmox management, Mac Mini |
| 40 | Storage | NAS, storage traffic |
| 50 | Prod | Service management |
| 51 | Prod | Ansible/automation |
| 52 | Prod | Vault |
| 53 | Prod | K8s masters |
| 54 | Prod | K8s workers |
| 55 | Prod | Monitoring |
| 60 | Dev | Service management |
| 61 | Dev | Ansible/automation |
| 62 | Dev | Vault |
| 63 | Dev | K8s masters |
| 64 | Dev | K8s workers |
| 65 | Dev | Monitoring |

### ACL Strategy

| Enforcer | Handles |
|----------|---------|
| ER605 | Cross-environment deny (prod ↔ dev) |
| ER605 | Internet access control |
| ER605 | VPN tunnel to AWS |
| ER605 | Management VLAN cross-service deny |
| FS308GP (later) | Intra-environment isolation (VLAN 50-55 internal) |
| FS308GP (later) | Service-specific port rules within same environment |

**Key principle:** ER605 enforces security boundaries. Switch handles traffic efficiency. Never split security enforcement for the same boundary.

**Important:** Switch ACL rules for service isolation (Vault access, K8s plane separation) will be added WHEN each service is deployed. Not before. Avoid locking yourself out before knowing exact port requirements.

